    "background_story": "Niko was a charming and charismatic rockstar known for his electrifying performances on stage. However, his reputation for being oversexed often preceded him. Groupies and fans would swoon over his good looks and seductive charm, and Niko rarely resisted the temptation. His conquests were the stuff of legend, with many claiming to have been 'Niko'd' after a night with the rock god. But beneath the fa\u00e7ade of a sex-obsessed playboy, Niko struggled with commitment and intimacy. His inability to form meaningful relationships led to a string of broken hearts and a reputation that often overshadowed his musical talents. As he approached middle age, Niko began to realize that there was more to life than just sex and fame, and he started to crave something more substantial.",
